                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Cause:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10025-1785902-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%"><div class="dynamicSelectValue">Application Misuse</div>
</td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Cause Detail:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_17287-1785902-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      There was a huge load on Ability database caused ora**e background processes to fail. 
  </td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Resolution:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10026-1785902-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%"><div class="dynamicSelectValue">Restart (Server/Service)</div>
</td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Resolution Detail:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_17288-1785902-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      Support killed blocking sessions and then bounced the CBS database via CAT1 Emergency Change <a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/browse/MTNI-760463" title="To stop/start all TT services/apps and Restart post2p oracle DB to release high concurrency  " class="issue-link" data-issue-key="MTNI-760463"><strike>MTNI-760463</strike></a>.
  </td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Impacted Services:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10717-1785902-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      Below services were impacted:<br/>
Subscribers are unable to connect to UMS IVR pilots on the following short codes 721, 727, 711, 7033, 714, 700, 600<br/>
DPOS registration success rate is dropped to 1%<br/>
eShop registration success rate is dropped to 78%<br/>
CLM portal success rate is dropped to 81%<br/>
NGPG success rate is dropped to ~95%<br/>
MFS-Erefill success rate is dropped to ~97%<br/>
Buyable Offer activation success rate from USSD, MyIrancell (App and Web) and eShop channels is dropped to 2%<br/>
AAT lending flow  success rate on MyIrancell channel is dropped to 24%<br/>
Also, iChat platform has fluctuation 
  </td>
            </tr>
