        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-1703327"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="alireza.aghaja" id="word_commented_alireza.aghaja" href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alireza.aghaja">Alireza Aghajanzadeh Gheshlaghi [ Arya Hamrah Samaneh ]</a>
                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">15/May/22</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-1703327"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Dear Mehdi/Fatemeh,<br/>
Oracle background processes got impacted due to huge load and DB won’t function properly without a bounce.<br/>
we already killed blocking sessions in DB an OS but the impact already done.<br/>
We have to bounce the DB to fix the background process issues.<br/>
Please advice.</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-1703074"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="mohammadali.ar" id="word_commented_mohammadali.ar" href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mohammadali.ar">Mohammadali Arab Yar Mohammadi [ MTNIrancell ]</a>
                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">15/May/22</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
