            <p>High load on DB caused oracle background processes to fail</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-1704579"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="hamidreza.saa" id="word_commented_hamidreza.saa" href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=hamidreza.saa">Hamidreza Saadat Pour [ MTNIrancell - Labs ]</a>
