            <p>issue has been fixed </p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-1705811"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="mohammadali.ar" id="word_commented_mohammadali.ar" href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mohammadali.ar">Mohammadali Arab Yar Mohammadi [ MTNIrancell ]</a>
                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">16/May/22</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-1705811"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>SM Conclusion:</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Cause: <br/>
There was a huge load on Ability database caused ora**e background processes to fail.</p>

<p>Impact: <br/>
• DPOS registration success rate is dropped to Zero<br/>
• CLM portal success rate is dropped to around 20%<br/>
• Subscribers are unable to connect to some UMS IVR pilots<br/>
• MFS erefill success rate is dropped to 97%<br/>
• NGPG success rate is dropped to 93%<br/>
• eShop registration success rate is dropped to Zero<br/>
• Postpaid subscribers are unable to login to MyIrancell application<br/>
• Buyable Offer activation success rate from USSD, MyIrancell (App and Web) and eShop channels is dropped to 2%<br/>
• AAT Lending on MyIrancell channel is impacted<br/>
• iChat portal has fluctuation<br/>
Duration time: 15 May 10:45 to 13:15.<br/>
Resolution:<br/>
Support killed blocking sessions and then bounced the CBS database via CAT1 Emergency Change <a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/browse/MTNI-760463" title="To stop/start all TT services/apps and Restart post2p oracle DB to release high concurrency  " class="issue-link" data-issue-key="MTNI-760463"><del>MTNI-760463</del></a>.</p>

<p>More details will be provided through RCA process.</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-1707027"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="zeinab.sale" id="word_commented_zeinab.sale" href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zeinab.sale">Zeinab Salehi [ MTNIrancell - ITS ]</a>
                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">18/May/22</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
