            <p><font color="#00875a">Received Zabbix notifications are attached</font><br/>
<span class="nobr"><a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/attachment/742241/742241_Severity++Average.msg" title="Severity  Average.msg attached to MTNI-760378">Severity  Average.msg<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span> <span class="nobr"><a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/attachment/742242/742242_Problem+++MW+and+IVR+Connectivity+Checking+-+EIA+Business+roles+-+IVR+API+Failure+on+side+of+MW+is+more+than+10%25.msg" title="Problem   MW and IVR Connectivity Checking - EIA Business roles - IVR API Failure on side of MW is more than 10%.msg attached to MTNI-760378">Problem   MW and IVR Connectivity Checking - EIA Business roles - IVR API Failure on side of MW is more than 10%.msg<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span> <span class="error">&#91;^Problem   @bility - dru104a_post2p Database - Database is NOT Accessible.msg&#93;</span> <span class="nobr"><a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/attachment/742244/742244_Severity++Average+%281%29.msg" title="Severity  Average (1).msg attached to MTNI-760378">Severity  Average (1).msg<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span> <span class="nobr"><a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/attachment/742245/742245_Problem+++Ability+-+dru104a+-+Critical+CPU+Utilization.msg" title="Problem   Ability - dru104a - Critical CPU Utilization.msg attached to MTNI-760378">Problem   Ability - dru104a - Critical CPU Utilization.msg<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-1719543"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="zeinab.sale" id="word_commented_zeinab.sale" href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zeinab.sale">Zeinab Salehi [ MTNIrancell - ITS ]</a>
