            [
                <font color="#336699">29/May/22</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-1719543"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Dear <a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mohammadamin.mir" class="user-hover" rel="mohammadamin.mir">Mohammadamin Mir Shekari [ MTNIrancell - Labs ]</a> <a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mehdi.asi" class="user-hover" rel="mehdi.asi">Mehdi Asi [ Tecnotree ]</a><a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=soroush.sa" class="user-hover" rel="soroush.sa">Soroush Sadegh Bayan [ MTNIrancell - ITS ]</a><a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ramin.ba" class="user-hover" rel="ramin.ba">Ramin Baghaei Mehr [ MTNIrancell - ITS ]</a><br/>
Kindly clarify about below items: <br/>
1-	About library cash mute X ,as you mentioned “Because of the varied causes, it is important to find the correct cause; so that the right solution can be implemented.” Please share your plan to find the exact root cause and then implement the right solution <br/>
2-	Please share what was the exact job related to monitoring which is already stopped and clarify by whom is stopped and when.<br/>
3-	About Hard Parse and Zabbix top query , please share result of investigation with P&amp;C team <br/>
4-	Since this major incident happened close to Bill run change, was there any preparation activity which caused load on database <br/>
5-	Please clarify if there is a possibility to set monitoring on Control version count and hard parse is based on coming query/operation by Zabbix <br/>
6-     Please share all jobs and its description which killed to control the load before bouncing the database</p>

<p>Dear <a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mehdi.kheir" class="user-hover" rel="mehdi.kheir">Mehdi Kheir Andish [ MTNIrancell - ITS ]</a><a href="https://icare.mtnirancell.ir/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=seuneh.b" class="user-hover" rel="seuneh.b">Seuneh Barkhordari [ Arya Hamrah Samaneh ]</a><br/>
Please calrify about below item :<br/>
1-	Is there any monitoring on OS /DB level to notify about high number of cash mute X  infrastructure before database get freeze </p>
        </td></tr>
